{
  "id": "comparison",
  "name": "Comparison: blue professional",
  "description": "Two tinted cards side by side, each with a bold column name and a blue-ruled list; the right one has a blue border and is the side the conclusion lands on. Two stacked paragraphs would lose the tension of the side-by-side contrast.",
